msgctxt "custom/000/JobDefSmn_00097:TEXT_JOBDEFSMN_00097_YMHITRA_101_051:1"
msgid "But it is past time I visited the Roost, and spent some time with my sister. My conjury skills should be of some use in caring for her."
msgstr ""

